{"page":20248,"part":1,"text":"○勒势第二\n\n勒不得卧其笔，中高两头下以笔心压之。口诀云：头傍锋仰策，次迅收若一出，揭笔不，而暗收则薄圆而疏，笔锋以及纸须微进，仰策峻趋。问曰：勒不言画而言勒，何也？\n\n论曰：勒者，笔而行，承其虚画，取其劲涩则功成矣。今止言画者，虑在不，一出便画，则锋单而怯薄也。夫勒者藉于坚，则笔劲涩，亡其流滑，庶可称上矣。《笔诀》云：策笔须勒，仰笔覆收。准此则形势自彰矣。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20248,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"7f971cab363b502e4daac5c54e2b34e1470256676db4d5447fe9fd31d08687d2","textSha256":"7f971cab363b502e4daac5c54e2b34e1470256676db4d5447fe9fd31d08687d2","fileSha256":"7f971cab363b502e4daac5c54e2b34e1470256676db4d5447fe9fd31d08687d2","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20248-wolai-5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"永字八法 · ○勒势第二","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"f11d82b9dec9bc012b4fe9231681ae86ddb29eae829e8ae5a0716e4c8e6b3b00","id":"r14wzbMdBP4o3TrBZ1mCwF","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"subHeader","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":5},{"start":7,"end":83,"sourceTextSha256":"537dca861057899a320c8b030f8b8619860dc9cfac91f3bb990ab7340bf65fb7","id":"2CHnnqha7QPT1MDWSMFtvU","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":76},{"start":85,"end":180,"sourceTextSha256":"c4be67b9b458deac29ec0c9eff10ec835d0980057db18ed9630de24c9b995892","id":"tAJWRujMoEgMCvRdPMBaMr","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":95}]},"segments":[{"start":0,"end":5,"quote":"○勒势第二","role":"structure","category":"篇章标题","note":"来源原有标题","contextStatus":"com